== Documented Changes ==
=== Gameplay changes ===
* Reduced the cooldown of {{i|Placebo}} with stat upgrades, Pretty Fly and Experimental Pill
* {{c|The Lost}}'s hearts are now hidden again ({{i|Holy Mantle}} indicator is still visible)
* Enemies are no longer guaranteed to drop coins when encountered in a previously visited room as {{c|Tainted Keeper}}
* {{i|Glyph of Balance}} no longer drops soul hearts when playing as the Lost
* Glyph of Balance can now drop soul hearts, red hearts as Bethany, Tainted Bethany if they need any
* Glyph of Balance can now drop poop pickups as Tainted ??? if he needs any
* {{i|Esau Jr.}} now preserves [[Item Tags quest|quest items]] (such as the Polaroid and the Negative)
* Added {{i|Red Stew}} to the [[Ultra Secret Room (Item Pool)|Ultra Secret Room pool]]
* Added even more new room layouts
* Updated a few item qualities
* Updated localization files

=== Fixes ===
* Fixed {{a|The Marathon}} achievement not usually unlocking (dailies completed before this update may not count)
* Fixed the daily exit confirmation popup not rendering correctly in the Chinese translation
* Fixed the Continue option becoming unavailable when switching languages while mods are enabled
* Fixed {{c|Tainted Judas}}' {{i|Birthright}} not working as intended
* Fixed {{c|Tainted Cain}} being able to take fatal devil deals without dying (again)
* Fixed Tainted Cain not being able to pick up items normally in the {{i|Death Certificate}} area
* Fixed victory lap popup displaying the wrong message
* Fixed the victory lap HUD icon clipping into the stat display
* Fixed lava pits not refreshing properly if the game window was resized
* {{i|20/20}} now decreases the damage given by Polyphemus similarly to other tear multipliers (this is still very strong since it cancels the firerate decrease from Polyphemus)
* Fixed 20/20 not increasing {{c|Keeper}} and {{c|Tainted Keeper}}'s firerate
* Fixed Tainted Keeper getting less coins than intended from enemies in Greed mode
* Fixed {{t|Telescope Lens}} and {{t|Door Stop}} appearing in Greed mode
* Fixed {{t|Butter!}} having a 100% chance to drop passive items on damage taken
* Fixed Butter! being able to drop active items on damage taken
* {{e|Red Chest}}s can no longer teleport the player to the Devil/Angel room while in the {{i|Genesis}} room
* Fixed {{e|Dark Esau}} not blocking enemy projectiles when not charging
* Fixed Dark Esau preventing white champion enemies from losing their invulnerability
* Fixed Esau Jr. removing Dark Esau when used as {{c|Tainted Jacob}}
* Fixed {{c|Tainted Lazarus}}' charge bar being visible in water reflections
* Fixed {{c|Tainted Lilith}}'s birthright preventing her from opening the flesh door in {{s|Mausoleum}} II
* Fixed {{i|Dogma}} giving hearts every time it is dropped and picked back up
* Fixed {{i|Mom's Ring}} spawning a rune every time it is dropped and picked back up
* Fixed {{i|Magic Mushroom}} and {{i|Leo}} granting the Stompy! transformation when repeatedly dropped and picked back up
* Fixed a {{s|Dross}} room that could have the right side entrance blocked by rocks
* Fixed a {{s|Depths}} room that could have {{e|Brain}}s behind rocks
* Fixed a {{s|Cathedral}} room that could have {{e|Polty|text=Polties}} appear on top of entrances
* Fixed a {{s|Flooded Caves}} boss wave in Greed mode sometimes causing a crash
* Fixed a crash caused by an “I’m Excited!” pill activating in a room with rain effects
* Fixed {{t|Expansion Pack}} rarely preventing the player from attacking
* Fixed not being able to go to {{s|Sheol}} after having used Genesis
* Fixed Genesis turning other characters into {{c|Isaac}} after having used Esau Jr
* Fixed {{r|Ultra Secret Room}}s very rarely generating in impossible locations, causing a softlock when teleported to via {{p|XVIII - The Moon?}}
* Fixed white fire rooms in {{s|Downpour}} and special button rooms in the {{s|Mines}} rarely generating connected to special rooms
* Fixed {{i|Decap Attack}} causing the head to hover endlessly over the player's body if recalled before the head hits the ground
* Fixed {{i|Trisagion}} lasers getting stuck when spawned by item interactions that create large amounts of tears
* Fixed a rare freeze caused by Trisagion + {{i|Continuum}}
* Fixed {{i|C Section}} synergies with melee weapons creating more fetuses (causing loops/crashes)
* Fixed a crash caused by picking up {{i|Strawman}} after {{i|Money Power}}
* Fixed {{t|Shiny Rock}} not doing anything
* Fixed {{t|Dice Bag}} causing the {{i|Whore of Babylon}} popup to appear whenever it gives a temporary dice item if the player has Whore of Babylon and is at low health
* Fixed {{t|Panic Button}} triggering on white fires
* Fixed quest items being disabled when the player carrying them dies in co-op
* Fixed {{i|Best Friend}} + {{i|Brimstone Bombs}} damaging the player
* Fixed {{i|C Section}} + {{i|Technology}} sometimes causing self damage when fired by familiars (such as {{i|Incubus}} and {{i|Twisted Pair}})
* Fixed {{i|Dr. Fetus}} / {{i|Epic Fetus}} + poison effects spawning harmful poison clouds when fired by familiars
* Fixed the light emanating from {{e|Dogma}}'s TV not rendering correctly

